{"client_side": "required", "server_side": "required", "game_versions": ["1.18.2", "1.20.1"], "environment": ["client_and_server"], "id": "FXDpZRJG", "slug": "trackwork", "project_type": "mod", "team": "COcZcH4S", "organization": null, "title": "Trackwork", "description": "Wheels and Tracks to drive around your world", "body": "Trackwork is an addon for Valkyrien Skies 2 and Create Mod, adding **tank treads** to traverse rough terrain in minecraft! Also, **WHEELS**!!!!\n\n![Wheeled and Tracked Vehicle](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c2d9c8e50e116af5d6123e49784ca1a879ec9f58.png)\n\nBuild your own vehicle and travel the world in style, race your friends or have a tank battle, with Trackwork _it just works™_. Be sure to read the Ponders or you will find yourself at the local repair shop real soon!\n\nFind us (please don't) and more Valkyrien Skies 2 addons in the discord:\n\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/dWwM8G3\">\n  <img src=\"https://assets-global.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/636e0b52aa9e99b832574a53_full_logo_blurple_RGB.png\" alt=\"discord icon\" class=\"xbGufb\" style=\"width: 320px; height: 48px;\" width=\"320\" height=\"48\">\n</a>\n\n\\\n\\\n\\\n<font size=\"1\">_(Warranty void if suspension is compressed. Trackwork is not responsible for any damage to property or mobs due to the use of Trackwork locomotion.)_</font>\n\n## Compatibility Notes\n- Optifine is NOT compatible. Period.\n- Embeddium: turn off block entity culling!\n- Embeddium plus: Turn off max dist block entity culling!\n- Graphene: disable block entity culling!\n\n## Credits\nTextures and models derived from [Create Mod](https://modrinth.com/mod/create)", "body_url": null, "published": "2024-07-05T04:05:24.502101Z", "updated": "2026-01-07T10:24:41.983945Z", "approved": "2024-07-08T02:26:26.178278Z", "queued": "2024-07-05T23:14:41.204126Z", "status": "approved", "requested_status": "private", "moderator_message": null, "license": {"id": "MIT", "name": "MIT License", "url"